<title>USA: Banco Sud Americano may tap U.S. bond market. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Banco Sud Americano may tap U.S. bond market. [CORRECTED 19:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects spelling of company name in headline and text)</p>
<p>Banco Sud Americano is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $100 million debt offering, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a Baa2/BBB-minus rated 10-year issue via Citicorp Securities, sources said.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the Chilean bank's offering.</p>
<p>((-- Nancy Leinfuss, 212 859-1675))</p>
